@startuml 14-multi-tenancy-flow
title Multi-tenancy flow — Filter chain → TenantContext → MDC → Hibernate

actor Client as C
participant "RequestIdFilter\n(HIGHEST_PRECEDENCE)" as RIF
participant "TenantContextFilter\n(HIGHEST + 10)" as TCF
participant "TenantResolver\n(Mock w dev, JWT w prod)" as TR
participant "TenantContext\n(ThreadLocal)" as TC
participant "MDC\n(SLF4J context)" as MDC
participant "Controller" as Ctrl
participant "Service\n(@Transactional)" as Svc
participant "Hibernate\n(MultiTenantConnectionProvider)" as Hib
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

C -> RIF: HTTP request\n(może mieć X-Request-Id)
activate RIF
note over RIF #LightBlue: Generuje albo czyta\nrequestId (UUID v7)\nMDC.put("requestId", ...)\nResponse header echo

RIF -> TCF: chain.doFilter()
activate TCF

TCF -> TR: resolve(request)
note over TR #LightBlue: MockTenantResolver (dev):\nzawsze zwraca DEFAULT_TENANT\n00000000-...-0001\n\nJwtTenantResolver (prod, post-MVP):\nczyta claim "tenantId" z Bearer JWT
TR --> TCF: Optional<TenantId>

TCF -> TC: TenantContext.set(tenant)
note over TC: ThreadLocal<TenantId>\nbinding tylko dla tego wątku!
TCF -> MDC: MDC.put("tenantId", uuid)

TCF -> Ctrl: chain.doFilter()
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Svc: send(command)
activate Svc
note over Svc: @Transactional otwiera tx

Svc -> TC: TenantContext.get()
TC --> Svc: TenantId
note over Svc: Service używa TenantContext\nbezpośrednio (np. ChatService.start)\nALBO Hibernate sam dodaje filtr

Svc -> Hib: repository.findById(id)
activate Hib

Hib -> Hib: TenantIdResolver.\nresolveCurrentTenantIdentifier()
Hib -> TC: TenantContext.get()
TC --> Hib: TenantId

Hib -> DB: SELECT * FROM messages\nWHERE id = ?\n  AND tenant_id = ?  ← automatycznie dodane!
note over Hib #LightBlue: HibernateTenancyCustomizer\nrejestruje resolver i\n@TenantId na entitkach\n→ Hibernate AUTOMATYCZNIE\ndodaje warunek do KAŻDEGO query

DB --> Hib: ResultSet (przefiltrowany per tenant)
Hib --> Svc: Entity

Svc -> Hib: repository.save(newEntity)
Hib -> DB: INSERT ... tenant_id = ?  ← automatycznie wstawione

Svc --> Ctrl: result
deactivate Svc

Ctrl --> TCF: response
deactivate Ctrl

note over TCF #LightYellow: try/finally w filter:\nzawsze clear ThreadLocal!\nInaczej leak między requestami\n(tomcat pooluje wątki)

TCF -> TC: TenantContext.clear()
TCF -> MDC: MDC.remove("tenantId")

TCF --> RIF: response
deactivate TCF

note over RIF: finally:\nMDC.clear()

RIF --> C: HTTP response\nX-Request-Id: ...
deactivate RIF

note over Hib #LightBlue: Async / Reactor scheduler:\nTenantAwareTaskDecorator\n+ ChatService.stream capture-restore\npropagują TenantContext + MDC\nna wątki workerów

@enduml
